ogram early in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/interdigital-inc-idcc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"IDCC 2024 Q3","e":"idcc","d":"2024-10-31","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Richard Brezski","x":"This portfolio of innovation drives our growth toward our long-term annual recurring revenue target of $1 billion across smartphone, consumer electronics and IoT, as well as video streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/interdigital-idcc-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"IDCC 2024 Q3","e":"idcc","d":"2024-10-31","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Liren Chen","x":"Both awards demonstrate why we believe our innovation will remain central to the video space, including consumer electronics, in streaming and in new, more immersive video experiences.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/interdigital-idcc-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"IDCC 2025 Q2","e":"idcc","d":"2025-07-31","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Scott Searle","x":"And then just the quick update on the streaming opportunity with the over-the-top players.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/06/interdigital-idcc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IDCC 2025 Q2","e":"idcc","d":"2025-07-31","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Liren Chen","x":"Regarding the streaming side here, we are in continuous dialogue with all the major players.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/06/interdigital-idcc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IDCC 2025 Q2","e":"idcc","d":"2025-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Anja Soderstrom","x":"And, also, there were some noise earlier this week or last week about some potential legislation that there would be some sort of tariffs or something on the IP.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/06/interdigital-idcc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IDCC 2025 Q2","e":"idcc","d":"